{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1463,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:87f2e3364500d8950803cf3d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像又做了奇怪的梦。\r\n起床的时候下巴感觉很累…\r\n到处去吃东西的梦已经做得够多了吧…",
      "source_fingerprint": "7bc3a52cf1d97db7211acfd6775b151c0d88b21170bd3014751d5e3047a377b2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:391a65e341e1904709ea5e71",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔…晚上不能喝太多的水\r\n我不想起床…\r\n然后和『那个』撞个正着…",
      "source_fingerprint": "ecbdad8f80d70bc43556de5bdd18324608d14acc1705e308e2063347a7c92412",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b7451c01277e02f4c9d91326",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新生们看起来速度都很快呢…\r\n为了不被追上，\r\n必须更加努力才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7be901c39970d21c584083283a425e2d575b4388e9717e64787cb282542ad9fc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:75ec46ee47e504d140d98971",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "太阳晒着不热吗…？\r\n那个…要不要戴上帽子、\r\n这样可能会舒服一些…",
      "source_fingerprint": "d4c1d42a0bb837b96957e15f527ac61907852fcf24122ea5ebe2a92bd3f4355f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:402146efd2d38b57c7a0170e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "竹夹鱼、青花鱼、乌贼…\r\n唔，转哪个点呢。\r\n…要不全都去！",
      "source_fingerprint": "efeb894077ea68b9bd2bb9c8b1df49e4adb8e487d10eaf64e8dbacd040866545",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a658f3d94e8dedbcfcadc825",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "冬天我爸爸休息的时候…\r\n会带我去冰钓。\r\n每年这个时候我都很期待…",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ad76ca83ea61133c239a04f291564ba5b68be849eacec02f8cad9297393ed55",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b88e1b898f9685512e016fda",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "祝你……快乐……情人节",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae1bbabaa14256a30aa9bc77f939359fec6528bb53124d9ff79b68511d589b60",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aaea3935af820792f6ef96e2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "必须把手帕还给北部同学…\r\n但是，她总被好多人包围着…\r\n想要进到人群里的话…唔…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e859de3457f19e71325a5b8bf6fe9ad7d5c8e142ff90b60cfa5aba56bcf2813f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7bb4f62ab9ada4ee00f94a24",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "『钓鱼老师』什么的…\r\n光钻同学好像有点\r\n太看得起我了…",
      "source_fingerprint": "37665706aeb207d3362761c922339e661cb9af12b23ac9f26c80e51bfbb215bd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9507efb6cce722a3f84781da",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "皇冠同学的美食评测写的太好了…\r\n呼…香港的肉包子\r\n我也好想尝尝…",
      "source_fingerprint": "74cfda48c925aace20e83252c572a8e93d524060025701060b519eec1a354398",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6541b39d0d8b5fd7923c1422",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "想玩投接球…\r\n但是想到要跟人交流…的话。\r\n…今天还是跟墙壁玩吧…",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd9c8c41e29b18eead603030629eb0dfd47fb5656abb07289ed50b9779416403",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f981f96b1c314126b3f362f1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天早上的报纸，\r\n姐姐的报道又占了很大的版面…\r\n唔，差距怎么会这么大呢…",
      "source_fingerprint": "02c3413f31276ae49085efc499f1019ee7acfd5af36ae988828f3727f1183b5a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a6653f7a616ff6dec167ddb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然想当第一名…但是。\r\n站在舞台中间这种事情，\r\n我真的能胜任吗…",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d317b32daede7601ef7b34c39d2fa96b6d3e1d489d9d75144dc6fdd5281379d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a29c4bec031ea12fa9cb8424",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "现在的我看起来不奇怪吗？\r\n比如衣服不合身，\r\n不适合穿这种类型之类的…",
      "source_fingerprint": "948843d27e0df572d66e59cd45eb0dc681316973b4f11f27ca70aad93e3a0911",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e84f28942c94fa33247405d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这个斗篷不管什么时候看都很漂亮…\r\n像发光的浮游生物一样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef1918d90677ade7091ebf749b314aa25f6f3e08a2a5ccaec250370fc78ae1cc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b4482468c535ae771e9b607d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只有穿着这个的时候，\r\n感觉会引人注目也无所谓。\r\n感觉好得…就不像是我自己一样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0c2f7bcc81db045d1d5248a07d453417a5c9fdde1a910c3eda33dc3fb1739272",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:69b27ed2587963dbae65aa91",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大鸣大放同学，\r\n又是第一批去晨练的。\r\n…我也要再起早一点。",
      "source_fingerprint": "64d2bbe2d7a35b5effb934a606379936f01fcb72db8d2300c52fb86a69b1cbca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:357c1216454d6ed2c4289a20",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "白天也在演奏，万籁同学，\r\n她果然很喜欢音乐。\r\n…好漂亮的音色啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "434f7b579f9e02957c9e80710ee0b1fda5c828b2ce84103fbda8c524f2a92a09",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d0a4176bd44a162a0dc424ca",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "作业已经做好了，课本也准备好了。\r\n接下来就睡觉…\r\n唔，再检查一遍吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ab3375ea0e7b97eb8f001e7fa130b55b1365f32f4ee1879b86f993002b675d1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7abd84dba6663391361c8abc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊，最近钓到一条好大的黑鲷鱼！\r\n呃…啊，不，不\r\n就这样，没什么，仅此而已…",
      "source_fingerprint": "02015f02b9eb04844977b56891c331992f2e34086efcd3d5cbf44e575d8f411e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d686346c2f4bfd5f7e16f31a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "妹妹强击送的泳衣…\r\n怎么办…！？穿不了这种飘逸\r\n又色彩缤纷的类型…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e33603346826ca598d3543a66aa910b56ea5c6f0a198a175cf7c7b1ac61b0e10",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:056f2040aa53da7ee49c1025",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "澳大利亚现在是春天。\r\n如果把枫叶的图片发给在那边的青梅竹马，\r\n一定会被吓一跳吧…",
      "source_fingerprint": "fca4caba145c98fca3bef9e49718978a9c312e2fa40a2cc36aa99a5aebeed1a5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:426e3629479269548b2aaea8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "冬天的肉包…感觉格外好吃。\r\n在寒冷的天气，热气腾腾的\r\n………呼…",
      "source_fingerprint": "2400fd34653fe6af47e734d870332b87a36411d6b48a9be804836d65459ecbf5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f91854dbd1e0cb691e8dbb63",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了不让我肚子着凉，父母给我\n寄了肚兜。只是，那种……\n那么可爱的狗狗图案，有点……",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d6272d60dea6cfa1f7f6b7839c20edfd9d75f0b1ec38e71ab6302f59ae1324e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d8054417f565febb1d6c473f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只有卫衣是我自己选的。\n所以，被你夸奖……\n我真的很开心……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c367073571bcbb2afd95710ba0416cc7b7a1c097baf7011886af46b52ac10ca7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f84ad33ad13dc9ecfdefd7e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "脚上的指甲油掉了……要不要再\n去找强击或者皇冠同学……\n不、这次我想自己试试看！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c23a949798433086323288dbba7753436c1fe77a6518c234e9c42ffd4257b5b0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ba04ab8450342f0e9265741",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "姐姐她们也在训练吗？\r\n…唔，不，集中精力，集中精力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "455e67bc123211adfb48fcecfe4c81a8cda6f2cab3ba0d4bdc63a87d2025aae3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:784d27124c024ea3d313e884",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "しまっていこう",
      "source_fingerprint": "56f6d0bf6a3e534ab4f8a54e3013003aa3b07f8486fa7d39ab88423b88ffeda9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f3c6b7cd98cbd204c008b2d4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "可以在加强一点训练强度吗…？\r\n如果还没有成效的话…",
      "source_fingerprint": "531c4331ffaacbaa14f112dd8520e38c14916762c38e2eb4350f2f4ff2cbd61e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:75b0500b78b2fa5467dd677b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呃…如果有什么在意的地方，\r\n可以帮我指出来吗…？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e49f28e581200d1fb2128dc0589f818b60abaf909025d34af12a08dadd005802",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:368dceb9394b9b2ef8fc8f23",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…吃下去的零食得赶紧消化掉。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ed7509957bb57eec2cb68ddb4bbf4167e56eb2d45f3cfcd520deec3d2a6edca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee2e4fbb2cdd0dab91c5bf13",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔，现在的我看起来怎么样？\r\n比起那时候…有稍微成长一些吗…？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c069e58231a1b4f3bd5e806bff3d3b0d8e4e9ab951f2d14b55b50ef16b3d1bc6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:376a4fcbb7cd33a953320f96",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有训练员在身边的话就可以安心了。\r\n…可以安心地前进。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b5433d7641d27c72859034ae3d1b2705131cf0d6fd83a40d20c717a411855c88",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a0298a412188d16373a60665",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那个…谢谢。\r\n谢谢你选择了我。成为了…\r\n我的训练员。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c09a3fc222358f999e99102bfc9321da76076cc51fbda54f3377fa52b869305",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:94ce2e22d7aea45e40c68d90",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "沙子的触感…好…\r\n…唔，集中精神，集中精神…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dae952e15bfc67be9119f455d6d45efd8879ea654d4b505597a5cbc76e0395fc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee8808b7cb958dab4ea81a10",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然称不上是夏日的太阳，\n但我也会燃烧起斗志……\n加、加油！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d87386ed74993b0d6c574a3cc6eae12b038fcc07112e7aa901381908b766ec2b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2368419b853e0a1fab1ad5e4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了防止缺水和缺盐，我带了很多\n运动饮料……\n会不会带太多了呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b10acf80b2f2aee78466847b5c7818493108002c7203eed44791503b95badcda",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f172fbfe0cab438edc210c11",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "像这身泳装一样，稍微大胆一点……\n大胆的训练……会是什么呢……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "90514d4231c1e0c8d45d8fb4b9d64c00379eca6585f770f88124ccabc1228606",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9819d3db7514681e3f1077d3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有一套是大鸣大放同学教我的\n热身动作。我能……\n稍微试试看吗……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8cb988ca36ce5bfb909a140d4aa71a16673a2171f83c7d978c1ac2a4130b9031",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:303c5b04fdf0a27f72aef84e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你心胸宽广又温暖……训练员就像\n夏日的大海一样，所以我才能把\n自己想说的话说出来吧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "d92dc338171ed9864a39d81c240f81c7e2b481585723e38c0c017488297765c2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a235d00d9b5c5754881bdae8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿上泳装真的会变得更开放……也许\n是真的。我想和训练员一起\n努力尝试各种事情……",
      "source_fingerprint": "79e34eb6ffb14dc7b9e3b8092fbae6f804f26de1741796b0328de203af1e9705",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b8962d2ce86e61211e84256d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然有时候也会徒劳无功……\n但比起以前一直不敢鼓起勇气的自己，\n现在的我更让我感到自豪。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d64136ff7a3369b175f9c9460e50631712cb26713c1e4e5ffd9a9930d15863b0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:825e30d5eb610dc6e4eb2684",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谢谢你…\r\n属于我的『伟大训练员』。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d8ea3076459be5bd65c005c761f94699e54b5232a9c0c17d46e4a7efc1dde08",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f1b07cb2f234142f56afab6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的优点…\r\n你教会了我很多。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7a0d6218655b4f19b7eafdc38fc716497605f1891d7544b0d60ec65ae9356c2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a555393de5d313758b5d1db",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下个赛季……还有更远的未来，\n也想和训练员先生一起走下去……",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9daaaa5e609917c06e077684921a815b45ffed3bb3d910cfcd34e203e250d79",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:17260af4e345f8ddf89cfd46",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "顺着波浪……我们才能走到这里啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d5dbdb7c171da6fe6c0e293ceef6e04547db51515b0daf935274d9e07b7668e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb8aac3419e6c25427bb8146",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "积累是很重要的，对吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "411f6fcd69125e3993ebd128784b8458ba2c609f0f6e43a3a4154a94806f2b58",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:14607b636f2c563485b7d4b0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我也有这样的力量…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "193df5a630e991dac2fc71b82e5d131fb5e1d7a98cef03ade2d0f9da0967f0d5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b7c0255b00bbc8da6327b362",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是高尚俊逸。\r\n那个…请多关照。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea3c4b94d165b8ffd070541b9780583cc7ab73ebfb43727994329845a7ec1343",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee783b376315cf3e3325e4b5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不能再蜷缩了…\r\n我也是，伟大的赛马娘…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "33f9ea4dd01da5da579a199c77fb242831aa518edc7695f785f5b2cabe0d3a10",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a15f54859f75b37e96af92aa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "役に立てるようにならなきゃ…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ce435417fb3269383b2e8c4b9d7e6ca96ca1dc2a2790a6b4d54a0b5d106eed1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7bf24f42f49490b4643664bc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "て、手伝えることがあるなら…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "58405ff293ec72926c751c943c94014811f68e38334ebd9e70a0b3f422155f35",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:344aac413f99dc9b8cd4bfc7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我、我要蜕变了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "194182919964e43fd29548f82f9ef6acc5c8d6de9865da777e957e9c31f481fb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d599e40710e94c7cc2da60a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "泳装的威力……好像真的很厉害……",
      "source_fingerprint": "958d07fb9735243c4f21d5227a4cc62e927429d02910958897df1e375a7594a9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:79ab3ebfe412b701c3fc54aa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "稍、稍微大胆一点……\n不不不，果然还是做不到……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e03ee96219385b5150a975d632e4b90d08f9db56b2ab11e4d4d5133df281d4a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "95009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f6b7e3d55054822f922b864f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "高尚、骏逸……\n不、不奇怪吗……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d734bc5d7db5195f729ebb44a932e218c5d3901a10175821a140962fb5948acb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "95010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6da536900384a0317f067ac7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "いいわ、見てあげる。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4628dbb1204aa16dfb2e5ee68ccd155d6c8565f5bed78c40505109454d7847be",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1090",
        "20051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d1e2b0e49566dfaaac82f2d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "示してみせるわ…、\r\n私の、女王としての矜持を。\r\nでなきゃ…っ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2228a4779da1e593470eba20052b93ed891c135016a5242d1fcf82efea3d04e3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1090",
        "400004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ea13af9873cec15af207e9d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "高尚也觉得自己受到大家应援的支撑，\r\n所以才想回应吧。\r\n这是很重要的事，非常重要。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6acd56dd0abe32fa3c16da052353e3088ebc867275f311932eb0f1e08871fe18",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1090",
        "400005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2ecfe4d3c3a06c01c498a6d3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "跟上来吧，强击！\r\n今后，我也会继续让你看到\r\n强大的背影……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "17208f8ec1d1b8c515e19b0059e7361953c5c4a489ffd777b3554f994c45ca6e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1090",
        "400007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:109c760cc41051a19ca8e4f5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "こちらはイベントミッションよ！\r\n頂点たるにふさわしい\r\n成果をあげていきましょう！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f39c0aafe9eb90587e674d96820c27564e7028ec9fbb895e1e316e052426582f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1090",
        "400012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f9260b70760a19b40c5fce4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "イベント、お疲れさまです。\r\n報酬は行いへの正当な評価です。\r\nしっかり受け取ってくださいね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "01cf2e1b6dfcd0250310cd4a32e744b6bedad9f6f8642f8164147ab538eb469a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1090",
        "400013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d5c22b7621d5665d44546cf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "目指すは『頂点』、おわかりですよね？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce90fbc779f449646a5f234ac848c26cd35972553cea5dde84fd69951f0d5fb5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1090",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6e122bfbb6d516e8ff3dbd22",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "さ、次はなにを手伝えば？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0cda4c97281a21a6a508da5b021653be88b99084603965529d6a96576a41c023",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1090",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd31ff63910099d58bfe3e73",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "どうぞ頼ってくださいな。",
      "source_fingerprint": "aa1350d2d65cb9a4d6de678f06ccc459d58c8d9e0d1e448a4132fb3b2bd63c45",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1090",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6e57bf65ac87889df64e9613",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "上吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3eb5b5f74ef2384c6c0a89d001ced307776a3b463e8ad6c297c9c98980420a95",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:964f35d623f0f038698813fc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和你一起的话即使是海的对面\r\n也能到达♪　无论世界何处\r\n都要带我前往哦♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "8997d85fc527ebe408abbd389a4587a417f01cd0d5292b599c149606c2f61777",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b8a7c7015b7307294cbfa8a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我出发啦~",
      "source_fingerprint": "698c2cc1ffd336d58630c670458028fcab40df52e6c4a1bdcc6de96366165a71",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c67578e65af5f2cc5c2090c2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我回来啦~",
      "source_fingerprint": "464c5fdc2e39f69c3f953f52447eb178a98976c447d3dd5387c573ca3f5b5e2a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:62a64e62390f8baf38fefa28",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有件衣服想去看看——\r\n但是妈妈又好像还有工作——\r\n……欸嘿，你能陪我去一下吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8091cc3ca58f5d84f341357aa508a7792d667dcdc7ea2a43da1cb5c33ab4324a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dfe1e0c4c437eaee22265310",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员亲的包修复的很漂亮呢！\r\n带着这条新换的带子\r\n一起再刻下新的回忆吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b23d2762788ea60363e834e020f30bc405438baab0fa0f9b338bf93c3b969f8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6c988d038f8413042d58bb66",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新年快乐！\r\n今年也和家人一起去了料亭。\r\n享受到了高雅的气氛~♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a911644619e15aed7ea35f1afaaea500f60862362adb04607e6f5f2dfaff0f6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:96a25c18e2ea74ce1c54ae64",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "已经和姐姐交换了巧克力♪\r\n骏逸亲还在搜寻中！\r\n看到她的话记得告诉我哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "644d32d7f503c821d11562e3176edbfe9215a7a60bb0c6635f0727a7ec7238fc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9d61f39c36b416a058f1918",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请给我巧克力~~~~♡\r\n欸嘿，果然有呢♪\r\n我就知道训练员亲会为我准备的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f12ac6153f533056e19939d65a96c53b7ecff1161fea2f90bb3390622faa7930",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8983e20cebb5b2d21fc9ab87",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "迪拜的夜间动物园好像很有趣♪\r\n周围都布满星空什么的\r\n不觉得超浪漫吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "549cb88f9ba1f8bce24e38646844bce4c93cfb9b557992f8a7e07502232edd07",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:065cecdcb015aea528f69a48",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "trick or treat☆\r\n训练员亲这么温柔，\r\n应该知道该选哪个对吧~？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e64efb24dfd0038a8f60fe841b530f82cf9d6c8e8f3ebc79b432fadc1f3f28d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c890c30be56e39dac50c8a9e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好想去看圣诞节彩灯啊~♪\r\n上流又华丽！\r\n呐，要不我们现在就去吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a6af9ef5216624dcd15bf596237d06319f453efae3fe9848b384e15cb7b7146e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:36665805b68ee7b0104c023d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员亲的房间里有圣诞树吗？\r\n需要我帮你装一个吗？\r\n保证能装的闪闪发光哦☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "64d39a41c97679a81e21322c4fd4e652878f69582cab202f90e737092a2bc7a8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:690ac8e263170b64575e738e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "太好啦——！",
      "source_fingerprint": "82c1a0a8005e85ea0f7f584b88aac0959555bba2d32d6344ac5428944ba3330e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:736b1198b45e1f090e67d3f7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今年也有了各种各样的回忆呢♪\r\n对了，要出些谜题测试一下\r\n还记得多少吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c8efe4f6f89aa26846fec0b0fc5d7bcfb442dee96bbedcddfbe780cbcee00be1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "10010"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
